  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": "To complete the medium appropriate amounts of solutions B to F are added to the sterile solution A in the sequence as indicated."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Final pH of the medium should be 7.0 – 7.2."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "comment": "Solution A is sparged with 80% N2 and 20% CO2 gas mixture to reach a pH below 6 (at least 30 min), then distributed in anoxic cultivation vials and autoclaved under the same gas atmosphere."
    },
    {
